  "fullDescription": "Imbue your creations with a touch of vintage flair, courtesy of Retro Monday, a distinctive display font. Radiating a cool, yet novel vibe, it effortlessly breathes new life into any design project. Whether you’re perfecting a logo, adding a personal touch to wedding invitations, establishing your brand, designing stickers or engaged in sublimation, Retro Monday brings an unexpected twist. Best of all, with PUA encoding, accessing all glyphs and swashes is a breeze – ensuring your designs are as seamless as they are stunning. Retro Monday is more than a font, it’s a perfect fusion of the old and new, facilitating creative expression like never before.",
